 "$comment": "OM-02 / ADR-011 golden action_digest vectors. Expected values come from an independent stdlib Python JCS (tests/kit/test_om_02_contracts.py recomputes them); the Java ActionDigest and the audit-verifier must reproduce them byte for byte. SH-08 adds the full JCS/receipt suite.",
